 # geo-evidence-mcp
 
-An MCP server and agent for Earth-observation questions where **every numeric answer ships with
-machine-checkable provenance**: STAC item, collection, band, CRS, acquisition time, processing level
-and a replayable tool-call trace.
+**A trust layer for agentic Earth observation.** An MCP server and a LangGraph agent that answer
+questions about Sentinel-2 imagery, where every number carries machine-checkable provenance and is
+verified before it reaches the user.
 
-Status: **M5 refusals and cloud masking**. The benchmark (M6) and the comparison run (M7) are not built yet.
